        ('Crab Raiders', 'Need to find a reliable water source closer to camp so we stop making such long trips. Keeping notes on where the rain collects in the rocks after storms.', ''),
        ('Crab Raiders', 'Trying to get on the elder''s good side so he''ll teach me the proper way to harvest shell plates. Offered to carry his gear on the next scouting run as a favor.', ''),
        ('Crab Raiders', 'I''ve been hoarding small mechanical bits I find in ruins, hoping to barter them for a proper crossbow. The old one I have keeps jamming and I''m more danger to myself than anyone else.', ''),
        ('Crab Raiders', 'Want to earn enough trust to lead a small scavenging party instead of always following orders. Been making sure I''m the first one up and the last one complaining on long marches.', ''),
        ('Crab Raiders', 'The sand keeps getting into the joints of my armor and rusting everything overnight. I''m experimenting with different animal fats to coat the metal and keep it moving smooth.', ''),
        ('Crab Raiders', 'Wants to keep a little extra food and clean bandages set aside so life inside Crab Raiders feels less precarious. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Crab Raiders', 'Hopes to hold onto a slightly safer sleeping spot and stop being pushed aside so easily within Crab Raiders. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Crab Raiders', 'Wants to keep one decent weapon, one spare repair item, and enough supplies to get through a bad week with Crab Raiders. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Deadcat', 'Keep the skinners away from the perimeter today and find enough scrap to trade for a decent weapon. A working sword would make the night shifts bearable.', ''),
        ('Deadcat', 'Patch the leaks in the shelter before the next rainstorm rolls in. Need to barter for some cloth or dried meat to get through the week.', ''),
        ('Deadcat', 'Check the northern ruins for any salvageable tech parts before the other scavengers get there. A few more cats saved up and passage south might actually be possible.', ''),
        ('Deadcat', 'Make sure the new arrivals understand the patrol routes and don''t wander off alone. The skinners have been too bold lately and losing people hurts everyone.', ''),
        ('Deadcat', 'Sharpen the old machete and practice forms for an hour before dusk. One of these days a skinner will test the defenses and it pays to be ready.', ''),
        ('Deadcat', 'Trade the copper ore hauled in yesterday for enough food to last the camp three days. The traders from the south always try to lowball so stand firm on the price.', ''),
        ('Deadcat', 'Find a pair of boots that actually fit before the soles fall off the current ones entirely. The rocks around the ruins chew through footwear faster than anything.', ''),
        ('Deadcat', 'Convince the older hands to share which ruined buildings still have salvage worth the risk. A good find could mean a week of not worrying about hunger.', ''),
        ('Deadcat', 'Memorize the safe paths through the rubble and mark the collapsed sections properly. Getting lost in the dead city at night is a death sentence with the skinners about.', ''),
        ('Deadcat', 'Save enough cats to buy a second canteen so the long scavenging runs don''t end in thirst. Clean water is everything when working under the hot sun all day.', ''),
        ('Deadcat', 'Learn which of the southern traders will give fair prices for scrap metal without asking dangerous questions. A reliable trading partner is worth more than any single haul.', ''),
        ('Deadcat', 'Keep watch over the wounded until they can walk again and make sure the fire stays lit after dark. The camp needs every pair of hands it can get and nobody gets left behind.', ''),
        ('Deadcat', 'Wants to keep a little extra food and clean bandages set aside so life inside Deadcat feels less precarious. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Deadcat', 'Hopes to hold onto a slightly safer sleeping spot and stop being pushed aside so easily within Deadcat. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Deadcat', 'Wants to keep one decent weapon, one spare repair item, and enough supplies to get through a bad week with Deadcat. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Dust Bandits', 'Needs to prove that pulling weight in camp is worth the food cost. Wants to find a decent weapon that doesn''t rust after one sandstorm.', ''),
        ('Dust Bandits', 'Wants to stash enough cats somewhere the boss won''t find them. Hopes to trade a few extra ration bars for better boots before foot rot sets in.', ''),
        ('Dust Bandits', 'Keeping track of which wells haven''t been claimed by stronger gangs. Planning to scout a new route that avoids Holy Nation patrols near the border.', ''),
        ('Dust Bandits', 'Looking for oil to keep the blade from getting worse. Needs to patch the holes in this jacket before the sand chafing becomes unbearable.', ''),
        ('Dust Bandits', 'Trying to figure out how to make the dried meat last another week. Hopes to find a trader willing to sell actual vegetables instead of scavenged scraps.', ''),
        ('Dust Bandits', 'Saving up enough scrap for a proper chest piece instead of these rags. Wants to find arm guards that don''t fall apart mid-fight.', ''),
        ('Dust Bandits', 'Making sure the younger raiders don''t pick a fight with the wrong caravan. Keeping watch for Starving Bandits creeping too close to camp.', ''),
        ('Dust Bandits', 'Hiding a small cache of cats where nobody else can find them. Planning to sit out the next raid if it looks too risky for the payout.', ''),
        ('Dust Bandits', 'Trying to get on the leader''s good side by handling camp chores without complaint. Avoiding the hotheads who might get everyone killed picking fights they can''t win.', ''),
        ('Dust Bandits', 'Practicing swings every morning to keep from falling behind the younger fighters. Wants to learn how to stitch wounds properly instead of just tying rags on everything.', ''),
        ('Dust Bandits', 'Looking for a cave or ruin that stays warm at night without giving away position. Hoping to convince a few others to move camp before the sandstorms get worse.', ''),
        ('Dust Bandits', 'Wants to be known as someone who keeps their word when making deals. Trying to build enough trust with passing traders that they don''t always reach for weapons first.', ''),
        ('Dust Bandits', 'Wants to keep a little extra food and clean bandages set aside so life inside Dust Bandits feels less precarious. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Dust Bandits', 'Hopes to hold onto a slightly safer sleeping spot and stop being pushed aside so easily within Dust Bandits. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Dust Bandits', 'Wants to keep one decent weapon, one spare repair item, and enough supplies to get through a bad week with Dust Bandits. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Empire Peasants', 'Save enough rice to last through the dry season without borrowing from the tax collectors. Find a second plot of soil behind the granary that nobody else has claimed yet.', ''),
        ('Empire Peasants', 'Earn a few extra cats by hauling crates at the trading post before the caravan leaves. Avoid the samurai patrol on the main road so they don''t shake me down for a bribe again.', ''),
        ('Empire Peasants', 'Patch the holes in my straw sandals before the long walk to the well gets any worse. Trade a basket of vegetables for a decent cooking pot that doesn''t leak at the rim.', ''),
        ('Empire Peasants', 'Keep my head down when the noble''s retinue passes through the market district. Save enough to buy a used cactus leaf for the roof before the rains come back.', ''),
        ('Empire Peasants', 'Get on the good side of the overseer by bringing him a cup of tea each morning. Maybe he''ll assign me to the indoor grain counting instead of the quarry labor.', ''),
        ('Empire Peasants', 'Scrape together enough cats to pay this season''s tithe without selling my only decent hoe. Barter with the fisherman downstream for something other than stale gruel for once.', ''),
        ('Empire Peasants', 'Learn which weeds around the field edges are safe to boil for a proper meal. Stay out of the drunken samurai''s way when he visits the tavern on market days.', ''),
        ('Empire Peasants', 'Mend the fence before the goats get into the vegetable patch again and eat everything. Convince my neighbor to share the cost of a new well rope between our plots.', ''),
        ('Empire Peasants', 'Find a scrap of leather to reinforce my belt before it snaps completely. Keep my work-gnarled hands clean enough that the merchants don''t turn me away from their stalls.', ''),
        ('Empire Peasants', 'Memorize the Okranite prayers well enough that the priest stops singling me out during services. Help my sister carry water from the distant well so she doesn''t collapse from the heat.', ''),
        ('Empire Peasants', 'Save a handful of seeds from this harvest to plant a private patch behind the old stone wall. Avoid getting conscripted for road labor by staying inside when the samurai come counting heads.', ''),
        ('Empire Peasants', 'Bury my meager savings where the tax collector''s thugs won''t think to look. Trade a few hours of sweeping at the tavern for a bowl of actual soup with meat in it.', ''),
        ('Empire Peasants', 'Wants to keep a little extra food and clean bandages set aside so life inside Empire Peasants feels less precarious. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Empire Peasants', 'Hopes to hold onto a slightly safer sleeping spot and stop being pushed aside so easily within Empire Peasants. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Empire Peasants', 'Wants to keep one decent weapon, one spare repair item, and enough supplies to get through a bad week with Empire Peasants. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Flotsam Ninjas', 'Need to prove I can pull my weight on raids without freezing up. Gotta find a decent weapon that isn''t rusted halfway through.', ''),
        ('Flotsam Ninjas', 'Patrol the eastern swamp edges before dusk and report any suspicious movements. Want to find a pair of boots that don''t soak through in the muck by next week.', ''),
        ('Flotsam Ninjas', 'Keep my blade sharp enough to cut through leather without bouncing. Need to stash some extra food where the others won''t find it.', ''),
        ('Flotsam Ninjas', 'Get the cook pot boiling before the raiding party comes back hungry and short-tempered. Want to trade for some actual spices instead of eating boiled swamp roots every day.', ''),
        ('Flotsam Ninjas', 'Figure out which veteran will vouch for me on the next camp shift. Have to stop losing at dice or I''ll never afford a proper mask.', ''),
        ('Flotsam Ninjas', 'Save up enough cats from the next haul to buy real ninja armor instead of these rags. Need to find a fence who won''t cheat me on the stolen goods.', ''),
        ('Flotsam Ninjas', 'Keep my squad alive through the next raid on the trade road. Should patch the holes in my tent before the rains get worse.', ''),
        ('Flotsam Ninjas', 'Let this leg heal properly so I can walk without limping during drills. Need to earn back the respect I lost getting wounded on my last patrol.', ''),
        ('Flotsam Ninjas', 'Sort through the latest loot and figure out what''s actually worth trading in town. Want to find a reliable buyer for the holy books we keep taking off pilgrims.', ''),
        ('Flotsam Ninjas', 'Watch how the senior ninjas move during ambushes and copy their footwork. Need to stop flinching when blades come out or I''ll never make raider rank.', ''),
        ('Flotsam Ninjas', 'Keep an eye on those Fog Men creeping closer to our patrol routes. Want to reinforce my arm wraps so the swamp thorns stop cutting up my forearms.', ''),
        ('Flotsam Ninjas', 'Make sure the new recruits learn proper ambush discipline before they get someone killed. Need to find decent medical supplies before the next raid goes wrong.', ''),
        ('Flotsam Ninjas', 'Wants to keep a little extra food and clean bandages set aside so life inside Flotsam Ninjas feels less precarious. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Flotsam Ninjas', 'Hopes to hold onto a slightly safer sleeping spot and stop being pushed aside so easily within Flotsam Ninjas. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Flotsam Ninjas', 'Wants to keep one decent weapon, one spare repair item, and enough supplies to get through a bad week with Flotsam Ninjas. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Grass Pirates', 'Find a dry patch of ground to sleep on tonight before the swamp floods again. I need to scrub the rust off this sabre before it snaps in a fight. I also want to find a replacement for my rotting shirt.', ''),
        ('Grass Pirates', 'Secure enough stolen meat to keep my belly full for a few days. I also need to remind that new recruit who is in charge around the campfire. Later I will mend the strap on my backpack.', ''),
        ('Grass Pirates', 'Sneak an extra ration of grog from the main stash without the boss noticing. I plan to avoid the next patrol shift so I can sleep in the reeds.', ''),
        ('Grass Pirates', 'Hide this nice stolen katana until I can trade it for a proper backpack. I need to find a first aid kit before my leg wound gets infected.', ''),
        ('Grass Pirates', 'Keep a close eye out for Hound patrols near the border. I need to patch the hole in my right boot so the swamp muck stops seeping in.', ''),
        ('Grass Pirates', 'Practice moving silently through the mud without making a sound. I hope to earn a bit of respect from the older crew by bringing in a decent haul. I must remember to clean the mud off my gear before sunset.', ''),
        ('Grass Pirates', 'Hunt some swamp turtles for the evening stew. I must find a fresh water source since the nearby puddle is getting stagnant.', ''),
        ('Grass Pirates', 'Stay off my injured leg and let it heal properly. I need to sit out the next raid without looking like a coward. I will ask the medic for some extra bandages tomorrow.', ''),
        ('Grass Pirates', 'Sharpen my rusty blade on a river stone before the next ambush. I want to find a taller patch of grass to hide in during patrols.', ''),
        ('Grass Pirates', 'Spot rich travelers on the road before the rival gangs do. I need to stay awake during the night shift by chewing on some bitter roots. I should also repair the torn pocket on my vest.', ''),
        ('Grass Pirates', 'Patch the leaky tent before the evening rain hits. I should count the stolen rations to make sure nobody is skimming off the top.', ''),
        ('Grass Pirates', 'Gather a couple of loyal friends to watch my back in camp. I plan to demand a slightly larger share of the loot from our next victim. I need to be careful not to anger the boss while doing it.', ''),
        ('Grass Pirates', 'Wants to keep a little extra food and clean bandages set aside so life inside Grass Pirates feels less precarious. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Grass Pirates', 'Hopes to hold onto a slightly safer sleeping spot and stop being pushed aside so easily within Grass Pirates. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Grass Pirates', 'Wants to keep one decent weapon, one spare repair item, and enough supplies to get through a bad week with Grass Pirates. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Grayflayers', 'Needs to replace the rusted shackles before the next raid into the swamp villages. Wants to earn enough cats to afford a proper weapon instead of this dull machete.', ''),
        ('Grayflayers', 'Hopes to get assigned to the northern patrol route where the pickings are easier. Worries that the newer recruits are getting sloppy with prisoner counts.', ''),
        ('Grayflayers', 'Plans to barter with the Hounds for better healing supplies before the humid season sets in. Dreams of saving enough to buy a second pair of boots that actually keep the swamp water out.', ''),
        ('Grayflayers', 'Wants to prove reliability enough to be trusted with guarding the slave pens overnight. Keeps head down and follows orders without question to avoid drawing the wrong kind of attention from leadership.', ''),
        ('Grayflayers', 'Needs to find a reliable source of dried meat that does not cost half the take from each raid. Hopes to trade some salvaged armor pieces for a better crossbow string.', ''),
        ('Grayflayers', 'Worries that the escaped prisoners from last week might circle back with friends. Intends to reinforce the cage locks with wire salvaged from the ruined outpost.', ''),
        ('Grayflayers', 'Plans to challenge the next promotion opportunity by volunteering for the riskiest part of ambush duty. Just wants a dry place to sleep that isn''t crawling with swamp insects.', ''),
        ('Grayflayers', 'Has been eyeing a better sword belt from the trade goods stash but knows better than to take without permission. Hopes the boss assigns them to the border watch where there is less marching through muck.', ''),
        ('Grayflayers', 'Wants to learn how to set proper swamp snares to supplement rations during long stakeouts. Keeps a small cache of personal rations hidden because trusting others with food is a losing gamble.', ''),
        ('Grayflayers', 'Needs to patch the leaks in the shelter roof before the heavy rains come again. Hopes to earn enough favor to be allowed to sleep inside the main building instead of the drafty annex.', ''),
        ('Grayflayers', 'Plans to shadow the senior raiders on their next supply run to learn the better trade routes. Wants a pair of gloves that do not fall apart after two weeks of hauling prisoners.', ''),
        ('Grayflayers', 'Worries about the growing number of hostile scouts near the eastern trails. Hopes to convince the quartermaster to issue better armor padding before someone gets gutted on patrol.', ''),
        ('Grayflayers', 'Wants to keep a little extra food and clean bandages set aside so life inside Grayflayers feels less precarious. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Grayflayers', 'Hopes to hold onto a slightly safer sleeping spot and stop being pushed aside so easily within Grayflayers. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Grayflayers', 'Wants to keep one decent weapon, one spare repair item, and enough supplies to get through a bad week with Grayflayers. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Holy Nation Outlaws', 'Need to find a replacement blade before the next raid because this notched thing will get me killed. Should also check the western approaches for patrol movements since nobody else bothers.', ''),
        ('Holy Nation Outlaws', 'Gotta earn enough cats to afford proper bandages instead of relying on those filthy rags. Want to start sleeping closer to the fire at night where it is safer and warmer.', ''),
        ('Holy Nation Outlaws', 'Should practice drawing my weapon faster because hesitation means death when paladins show up. Need to patch the holes in my boots before foot rot sets in from the swamp water.', ''),
        ('Holy Nation Outlaws', 'Must find a way to trade these stolen holy books without getting shanked by our own people. Want to save enough for a decent backpack so I can carry more salvage from ruins.', ''),
        ('Holy Nation Outlaws', 'Have to convince the others I am trustworthy enough to guard the stash. Should learn how to pick locks better because breaking doors makes too much noise.', ''),
        ('Holy Nation Outlaws', 'Need to figure out who has been stealing rations from the supply pile and deal with them quietly. Want to get on the leader''s good side so I can move up from cooking duty.', ''),
        ('Holy Nation Outlaws', 'Should repair the leather armor before it falls apart completely because I cannot afford new gear. Have to avoid drinking with that crowd from the northern camp since they start fights they cannot finish.', ''),
        ('Holy Nation Outlaws', 'Want to find a reliable source of clean water since the nearby stream is making people sick. Need to prove I can handle a watch shift without falling asleep like last time.', ''),
        ('Holy Nation Outlaws', 'Must stash some emergency supplies away from camp in case we have to scatter when the inquisitors come. Should figure out which of the new recruits is most likely to sell us out.', ''),
        ('Holy Nation Outlaws', 'Have to trade these broken crossbow parts for something useful before they rust completely. Want to find a quieter spot to sleep because the snoring near the back wall is unbearable.', ''),
        ('Holy Nation Outlaws', 'Need to work on my footwork in a fight since I keep tripping over rocks and debris. Should ask around about which traders will deal with us without running to the authorities.', ''),
        ('Holy Nation Outlaws', 'Want to learn a few more recipes from the desert traders so we can stretch our dried meat further. Have to keep my head down around the veterans until I have been here long enough to talk back.', ''),
        ('Holy Nation Outlaws', 'Wants to keep a little extra food and clean bandages set aside so life inside Holy Nation Outlaws feels less precarious. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Holy Nation Outlaws', 'Hopes to hold onto a slightly safer sleeping spot and stop being pushed aside so easily within Holy Nation Outlaws. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Holy Nation Outlaws', 'Wants to keep one decent weapon, one spare repair item, and enough supplies to get through a bad week with Holy Nation Outlaws. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Inaba Ronin', 'Keep the campfire burning through the night so the others stop complaining about cold rice. Find a decent whetstone to replace the borrowed one before its owner notices.', ''),
        ('Inaba Ronin', 'Save enough cats from odd jobs to afford a proper katana instead of this rusted borrowed blade. Stay on the good side of the senior members by handling the morning patrols without complaint.', ''),
        ('Inaba Ronin', 'Sneak an extra ration of sake from the communal stores without the quartermaster catching on. Avoid getting dragged into another gambling debt dispute between the younger hotheads.', ''),
        ('Inaba Ronin', 'Maintain the leather armor stitching before it falls apart completely on the road. Earn a reliable spot in the next escort job so there is guaranteed pay coming in.', ''),
        ('Inaba Ronin', 'Practice the basic draws in private so the veterans stop mocking sloppy form. Find a place to sleep that is not directly under the leak in the roof.', ''),
        ('Inaba Ronin', 'Trade the spare weapon parts for a better pair of sandals before the next long march. Figure out which of the new recruits can actually be trusted to stand watch without falling asleep.', ''),
        ('Inaba Ronin', 'Convince one of the older swordsmen to share a few techniques during the afternoon drills. Scrounge enough ingredients to make a proper pot of stew tonight instead of plain rice again.', ''),
        ('Inaba Ronin', 'Keep head down and avoid picking sides in the ongoing argument about which town to camp near. Mend the torn cloak before the desert winds pick up and make the cold unbearable.', ''),
        ('Inaba Ronin', 'Get the local shopkeeper to extend credit just one more week until the protection money comes in. Find a quiet corner away from the snoring drunks to get a decent night of rest.', ''),
        ('Inaba Ronin', 'Prove reliability by delivering messages between the scattered camp spots without delay. Save up for a second canteen because the long shifts between wells are getting painful.', ''),
        ('Inaba Ronin', 'Haggle a better price for the salvaged armor pieces piled in the back of the supply tent. Keep the new recruits from doing something stupid enough to bring the city guards down on the camp.', ''),
        ('Inaba Ronin', 'Memorize the patrol schedule so there is always an excuse to avoid the worst shifts. Find a moment of peace by the river to wash the road dust out of clothes and hair.', ''),
        ('Inaba Ronin', 'Wants to keep a little extra food and clean bandages set aside so life inside Inaba Ronin feels less precarious. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Inaba Ronin', 'Hopes to hold onto a slightly safer sleeping spot and stop being pushed aside so easily within Inaba Ronin. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Inaba Ronin', 'Wants to keep one decent weapon, one spare repair item, and enough supplies to get through a bad week with Inaba Ronin. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Kral''s Chosen', 'Keep the weapon racks organized and ensure every blade is sharpened before dawn patrol. Earn a place at the central fire instead of eating at the edge of camp.', ''),
        ('Kral''s Chosen', 'Find a decent pair of boots that do not chafe during long marches through the swamp. Save enough cats to buy a second canteen before the next extended patrol.', ''),
        ('Kral''s Chosen', 'Convince one of the veteran fighters to spar with me every other day so I do not lose my edge. Stop forgetting to check my armor straps before we head out.', ''),
        ('Kral''s Chosen', 'Figure out which ration packs are least likely to spoil in the humidity and trade for those specifically. Get on the good side of the quartermaster so I am not always stuck with the stale bread.', ''),
        ('Kral''s Chosen', 'Memorize the patrol routes around the southern approach so I can walk them without getting turned around. Stop flinching when the horn sounds for assembly.', ''),
        ('Kral''s Chosen', 'Repair the leaking section of the barracks roof before the next heavy rain comes. Trade some of my dried meat for a better sleeping mat.', ''),
        ('Kral''s Chosen', 'Prove I can carry a full pack as far as anyone else without lagging behind. Learn which of the older warriors will actually offer advice if you ask properly.', ''),
        ('Kral''s Chosen', 'Convince the camp cook to give me the larger portions by helping with the firewood every morning. Find a reliable spot to wash clothes where the water is not stagnant.', ''),
        ('Kral''s Chosen', 'Keep my armor oiled so the damp does not rust the joints. Write down the names of the fallen from the last skirmirmish so I remember to honor them at the evening fire.', ''),
        ('Kral''s Chosen', 'Earn enough trust to be assigned to the supply runs into town instead of staying on perimeter guard. Replace my fraying belt before it snaps during training.', ''),
        ('Kral''s Chosen', 'Stop waking up late and drawing the ire of the morning patrol leader. Find a quiet place outside camp where I can practice forms without an audience.', ''),
        ('Kral''s Chosen', 'Barter for a better knife for skinning game so I waste less meat. Make myself useful enough that the others stop calling me the new one.', ''),
        ('Kral''s Chosen', 'Wants to keep a little extra food and clean bandages set aside so life inside Kral''s Chosen feels less precarious. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Kral''s Chosen', 'Hopes to hold onto a slightly safer sleeping spot and stop being pushed aside so easily within Kral''s Chosen. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Kral''s Chosen', 'Wants to keep one decent weapon, one spare repair item, and enough supplies to get through a bad week with Kral''s Chosen. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Machinists', 'Needs to find a working generator part to impress the senior engineer and earn enough cats for a proper meal. She also wants to patch the leak in her tent before the next rainstorm.', ''),
        ('Machinists', 'Must finish calibrating the water pump pressure valves before nightfall to keep the outpost supplied. He also needs to secure a replacement lens for the workshop microscope from the next trade caravan.', ''),
        ('Machinists', 'Hopes to get assigned to the day shift patrol to avoid the freezing night winds. She also needs to hammer out the dent in her left leg prosthetic before it starts grinding.', ''),
        ('Machinists', 'Aims to salvage enough copper from the ruins to fix the main gate hydraulics. He just wants to save up enough cats to finally replace his rusted wrench with a proper skeleton smithing hammer.', ''),
        ('Machinists', 'Desperately wants to catalogue the newly unearthed schematics before the paper degrades further in the damp air. She is also looking for a quieter corner in the library to set up her desk away from the noisy forge.', ''),
        ('Machinists', 'Needs to sell the leftover scrap metal to the passing traders for a fair price instead of getting shortchanged. He also wants to find a reliable source of building materials for the new storage wing.', ''),
        ('Machinists', 'Trying to memorize the standard engine diagrams without making another costly mistake on the test bench. He hopes to earn his own set of calibration tools instead of constantly borrowing the rusty shared ones.', ''),
        ('Machinists', 'Wants to barter some spare electrical components for fresh meat instead of eating dusted rice again. She also needs to figure out why the automated cooking stove keeps shorting out every evening.', ''),
        ('Machinists', 'Looking for a safe route to the ancient workshop ruins to the east without running into spider bots. He hopes to find a spare filter for his dust mask before his current one gives out completely.', ''),
        ('Machinists', 'Intends to finalize the blueprints for the new irrigation system before the weekly review meeting. She is also trying to delegate the tedious welding work to the newer recruits so she can focus on design.', ''),
        ('Machinists', 'Needs to source some quality steel bars to fix the damaged skeletal limb of a visiting mercenary. She wants to make sure the mercenary pays upfront this time before handing over the repaired parts.', ''),
        ('Machinists', 'Aims to map the local sewer system for a safer salvage route into the city. He is saving up to buy a high-capacity backpack so he can haul more copper on his return trips.', ''),
        ('Machinists', 'Wants to keep a little extra food and clean bandages set aside so life inside Machinists feels less precarious. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Machinists', 'Hopes to hold onto a slightly safer sleeping spot and stop being pushed aside so easily within Machinists. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Machinists', 'Wants to keep one decent weapon, one spare repair item, and enough supplies to get through a bad week with Machinists. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Manhunters', 'Needs to catch at least one runaway this week to cover food costs. Wants to earn enough for a second pair of manacles so they can take on bigger jobs.', ''),
        ('Manhunters', 'Keeps forgetting to oil the chain links before they rust solid in the desert humidity. Hopes to track down that escaped copper mine worker before someone else claims the bounty.', ''),
        ('Manhunters', 'Worried the water skins are running low before the next outpost stop. Plans to trade two captured drifters for dried meat and a new pair of boots.', ''),
        ('Manhunters', 'Saving up for a quality jitte that won''t bend on the first swing. Needs to find a reliable fence who pays fair prices for healthy workers.', ''),
        ('Manhunters', 'The new recruits keep letting captives slip away during sandstorms. Wants to drill them harder on proper restraint techniques before the season turns.', ''),
        ('Manhunters', 'Lost three slaves to beak things last month and cannot afford another loss like that. Checking the cage locks twice each night now to be safe.', ''),
        ('Manhunters', 'The old leg wound still aches after long marches across the flats. Looking for a cheap prosthetic or at least better bandages at the next town.', ''),
        ('Manhunters', 'Does not trust the patrol leader''s route through the Spider Plains but cannot speak up without causing trouble. Trying to stay on the good side of the senior hunters to get fair shares of the profits.', ''),
        ('Manhunters', 'Keeps an extra weapon hidden in case the captives get ideas during camp. Wants to find a safer stretch of road to patrol where bandit attacks are less common.', ''),
        ('Manhunters', 'Practicing reading tracks in hard-packed dirt whenever the group makes camp. Hopes to become good enough to track solo and keep a bigger cut of the bounties.', ''),
        ('Manhunters', 'Tired of sleeping rough and eating dust every day. Dreaming of saving enough cats to buy a small shack in a quiet town someday.', ''),
        ('Manhunters', 'The routine sweep through the northern approach has been unprofitable for weeks. Thinking about suggesting a new patrol area to the crew chief before the others start complaining.', ''),
        ('Manhunters', 'Wants to keep a little extra food and clean bandages set aside so life inside Manhunters feels less precarious. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Manhunters', 'Hopes to hold onto a slightly safer sleeping spot and stop being pushed aside so easily within Manhunters. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Manhunters', 'Wants to keep one decent weapon, one spare repair item, and enough supplies to get through a bad week with Manhunters. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Mercenary Guild', 'Needs to prove reliable enough for better contracts and wants to upgrade from a rusted katana to something that won''t break mid-fight. Hopes to earn enough to sleep indoors more often.', ''),
        ('Mercenary Guild', 'Knees aren''t what they used to be and long patrols hurt worse each season. Setting aside a few cats each job toward eventually buying a small shack in a safe town. Just needs two or three more good payouts to make that happen.', ''),
        ('Mercenary Guild', 'Keeping the squad''s gear serviceable takes priority over personal comfort. Wants to find a reliable source of repair kits at a fair price instead of scavenging battlefield scraps. Someday hopes to afford a proper workshop instead of fixing everything by campfire.', ''),
        ('Mercenary Guild', 'Bad contracts lead to dead mercenaries so vetting clients matters more than chasing the biggest payout. Looking to build steady relationships with a few trustworthy employers rather than taking random work. A regular client who pays on time is worth three desperate ones.', ''),
        ('Mercenary Guild', 'Prefers escort jobs over bounties because the odds of coming home are better. Saving up for a decent set of armor instead of relying on padded cloth. Worries that one bad fight could leave them crippled with no savings.', ''),
        ('Mercenary Guild', 'Watching how the squad leaders operate and learning what makes them effective. Trying to earn the trust of experienced members so they''ll vouch for future promotions. A small command of their own would mean better pay and less risk.', ''),
        ('Mercenary Guild', 'The old leg wound still aches when it rains and medkits don''t grow on trees. Taking easier guard posts while healing up from the last job gone wrong. Just wants to work enough to stay fed without pushing the injury further.', ''),
        ('Mercenary Guild', 'A merc who drinks with the right people hears about jobs before they''re posted publicly. Keeping on good terms with the tavern keepers in three different cities. Figures knowing people is as valuable as knowing how to fight.', ''),
        ('Mercenary Guild', 'A full stomach matters more than glory and steady pay beats risky ventures. Looking for caravan escort work that includes rations as part of the deal. Saving whatever is left after meals toward a second canteen and better boots.', ''),
        ('Mercenary Guild', 'New recruits keep making the same mistakes that get people killed. Wants permission to run basic drills with the fresh hires before the next contract. A squad that can hold formation is worth twice their numbers.', ''),
        ('Mercenary Guild', 'Lost nearly everything in a botched job last month and still owes the guild for replacement gear. Taking any work available to climb out of debt even the ones nobody else wants. Just needs to survive long enough to break even.', ''),
        ('Mercenary Guild', 'Getting too old for front-line work and thinking about transitioning to a desk role. Hoping to leverage their experience into a guild coordinator position somewhere peaceful. Would settle for a permanent guard posting at a quiet outpost.', ''),
        ('Mercenary Guild', 'Wants to keep a little extra food and clean bandages set aside so life inside Mercenary Guild feels less precarious. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Mercenary Guild', 'Hopes to hold onto a slightly safer sleeping spot and stop being pushed aside so easily within Mercenary Guild. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Mercenary Guild', 'Wants to keep one decent weapon, one spare repair item, and enough supplies to get through a bad week with Mercenary Guild. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Messenger', 'Need to find a replacement strap for my pack before the next long haul out to the border zones. The buckles are holding for now but one good snag and everything spills across the sand.', ''),
        ('Messenger', 'Saving up for a better pair of boots because these are wearing thin on the soles and every stone hurts. Maybe if I take on a few extra short runs this week I can afford them by next month.', ''),
        ('Messenger', 'Trying to memorize the back routes between Waystations so I can avoid the main roads when bandits get bold. The older couriers say there are shortcuts through the valleys that shave hours off a trip.', ''),
        ('Messenger', 'Hoping to get assigned to the western routes where the pay is better and the weather is milder. Right now I keep drawing the dead-end runs to the ruined outposts and it barely covers my food.', ''),
        ('Messenger', 'Need to earn enough cats to replace my worn rucksack before it tears open on a delivery. Spent half my last run retying the rip and praying the parcel inside stayed dry.', ''),
        ('Messenger', 'Working on building trust with the Waystation keepers along the southern stretch so I can count on a warm corner during night runs. A decent relationship with them means I can move faster without worrying where I will sleep.', ''),
        ('Messenger', 'Wanting to pick up some basic first-aid skills because out on the trail there is nobody to patch you up when things go wrong. Saw a courier come back with a gash last week and he barely made it to town.', ''),
        ('Messenger', 'Trying to get faster at the river crossing near the Broken Coast because the toll takers there always slow me down. If I can find a cheaper or quicker spot my times will improve and the boss might notice.', ''),
        ('Messenger', 'Need to start carrying extra water because the last two runs nearly left me dry in the middle of nowhere. It adds weight but collapsing from thirst is not worth the saved ounces.', ''),
        ('Messenger', 'Hoping the senior courier will let me shadow them on a long delivery so I can learn how they handle the sketchy checkpoints. There is a trick to talking past the guards and I want to figure it out before I run that route alone.', ''),
        ('Messenger', 'Keeping my head down and trying not to draw attention from the rival runners who have been poaching contracts. As long as I deliver on time and keep the clients happy I should be fine.', ''),
        ('Messenger', 'Want to find a lightweight waterproof wrap for the documents I carry because rain keeps threatening to ruin them. Lost a letter to damp last month and the client was furious even though the ink was still readable.', ''),
        ('Messenger', 'Wants to keep a little extra food and clean bandages set aside so life inside Messenger feels less precarious. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Messenger', 'Hopes to hold onto a slightly safer sleeping spot and stop being pushed aside so easily within Messenger. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Messenger', 'Wants to keep one decent weapon, one spare repair item, and enough supplies to get through a bad week with Messenger. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Missionaries', 'Needs to repair the stitching on their travel pack before the next outreach patrol. They also want to memorize a new passage for evening recitation.', ''),
        ('Missionaries', 'Hopes to trade spare medkits for a pair of decent boots before the rains turn the roads to mud. A quiet word with the senior elder about their progress would ease their mind as well.', ''),
        ('Missionaries', 'Plans to stockpile dried meat in the mission cellar ahead of the lean season. They have been meaning to ask the cook for extra rations for the newer converts.', ''),
        ('Missionaries', 'Wants to finish copying the old scroll before the ink fades entirely. A brief rest in the courtyard would help their cramped hand.', ''),
        ('Missionaries', 'Worries about the cracked lens in their reading lamp and hopes the next trade caravan carries glass. They also want to share a modest breakfast with the gate guard to build trust.', ''),
        ('Missionaries', 'Seeks permission to accompany the supply run to the western outpost for a chance to stretch their legs. A warm meal at a wayside inn would be a welcome comfort.', ''),
        ('Missionaries', 'Intends to sweep the shrine floor before noon prayers and check the door hinges for rust. They quietly wish for a letter from their former teacher at the mother house.', ''),
        ('Missionaries', 'Aims to barter a spare holy text for a sturdy walking stick to ease their bad knee. Finding a quiet corner to practice readings away from the crowd would make the afternoon more bearable.', ''),
        ('Missionaries', 'Plans to mend the torn cloak left by a departed brother and store it for the next arrival. They also want to ask the quartermaster for a second water skin.', ''),
        ('Missionaries', 'Hopes to settle a minor disagreement over chore rotations without drawing the elder''s attention. A few hours of undisturbed meditation in the garden would steady their temper.', ''),
        ('Missionaries', 'Wants to polish the brass prayer bell before the evening gathering and oil the mechanism properly. Securing an extra blanket before the cold snap is also on their mind.', ''),
        ('Missionaries', 'Seeks to learn the basic thrust from the mission guard in exchange for help mending armor padding. They would like to share a pot of tea with the librarian afterward.', ''),
        ('Missionaries', 'Wants to keep a little extra food and clean bandages set aside so life inside Missionaries feels less precarious. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Missionaries', 'Hopes to hold onto a slightly safer sleeping spot and stop being pushed aside so easily within Missionaries. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Missionaries', 'Wants to keep one decent weapon, one spare repair item, and enough supplies to get through a bad week with Missionaries. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Mongrel', 'Keep the gate watch rotation organized so gaps don''t form during fog surges. Earn enough cats to replace the rusted bolt on my crossbow before it snaps mid-draw.', ''),
        ('Mongrel', 'Find a reliable route through the eastern fog banks that doesn''t cross Fog Men trails. Barter enough dried meat to last the week without owing favors.', ''),
        ('Mongrel', 'Prove I can handle patrols alone so the veterans stop babysitting me. Learn which fog patches are safe to cross at dusk versus dawn.', ''),
        ('Mongrel', 'Maintain the perimeter traps before they decay beyond repair. Save enough to buy a proper weapon instead of relying on this sharpened pipe.', ''),
        ('Mongrel', 'Trade my spare medical supplies for a better pair of boots. Find someone willing to teach me how to patch armor properly.', ''),
        ('Mongrel', 'Convince a patrol leader to let me join the next supply run. Practice moving quietly through the fog without freezing up at every sound.', ''),
        ('Mongrel', 'Stockpile enough basic components to keep the workshop running through the season. Earn a steady stream of cats from repair work instead of relying on scavenging.', ''),
        ('Mongrel', 'Get assigned to the inner gate shift where the fog doesn''t seep in so thick. Stretch my rations carefully so I don''t have to ask neighbors for food before the next trade caravan.', ''),
        ('Mongrel', 'Memorize the safe paths so I can guide newcomers without embarrassing myself. Find a decent secondhand backpack that doesn''t tear at the seams.', ''),
        ('Mongrel', 'Barter my trapped fog crawlers for a sharpening stone and some bandages. Check the eastern warning bells to make sure they still ring clearly.', ''),
        ('Mongrel', 'Spend more time sparring so I don''t freeze the next time Fog Men test the walls. Save up for a proper prosthetic to replace this splinted leg.', ''),
        ('Mongrel', 'Keep my head down and avoid drawing attention from the shinobi handlers. Find a quiet corner in the barracks where I can actually sleep without getting stepped on.', ''),
        ('Mongrel', 'Wants to keep a little extra food and clean bandages set aside so life inside Mongrel feels less precarious. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Mongrel', 'Hopes to hold onto a slightly safer sleeping spot and stop being pushed aside so easily within Mongrel. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Mongrel', 'Wants to keep one decent weapon, one spare repair item, and enough supplies to get through a bad week with Mongrel. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Nomadic Bandits', 'Need to find a replacement for this dull sword before the next raid. Also want to stay on the boss''s good side by volunteering for night watch more often.', ''),
        ('Nomadic Bandits', 'Got to figure out which stretches of the route have the fewest patrols this season. A decent pair of boots would make the marching tolerable again.', ''),
        ('Nomadic Bandits', 'Still owe Shova a cut from the last haul and she is getting impatient. Trying to gather enough dust from small passes to settle things without getting beaten.', ''),
        ('Nomadic Bandits', 'Want to prove I can lead a small scouting group instead of just following orders. Also need to patch the hole in my tent before the wind season hits.', ''),
        ('Nomadic Bandits', 'Trying to trade up for a crossbow so I can hang back during fights instead of charging in. Keeping my head down around the older bandits until I get stronger.', ''),
        ('Nomadic Bandits', 'The pack beast is favoring its left leg again and we cannot afford to lose it. I am hoarding a little extra dried meat just in case we get stranded between oases.', ''),
        ('Nomadic Bandits', 'Hoping to learn the southern trails well enough to become a permanent guide for the group. In the meantime I am staying awake during marches to memorize landmarks.', ''),
        ('Nomadic Bandits', 'Need to stay sober enough to keep up with the group but the days are boring otherwise. Trying to save a small stash of food that nobody else knows about.', ''),
        ('Nomadic Bandits', 'Working on reading the travelers we hit so I can tell which ones might have hidden coin. Want to get better at spotting armed escorts before we commit to an ambush.', ''),
        ('Nomadic Bandits', 'Just trying to avoid getting hurt again since healing supplies are scarce out here. Keeping my gear bundled tight so I can move camp quickly when we have to run.', ''),
        ('Nomadic Bandits', 'I want to earn a real place in this band instead of being the one who gets the worst shifts. Practicing my swing against fence posts when nobody is watching.', ''),
        ('Nomadic Bandits', 'Hoping to find a traveler who will trade fairly for once instead of running or fighting. Need to mend my shirt before it falls apart entirely and I am left with nothing warm.', ''),
        ('Nomadic Bandits', 'Wants to keep a little extra food and clean bandages set aside so life inside Nomadic Bandits feels less precarious. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Nomadic Bandits', 'Hopes to hold onto a slightly safer sleeping spot and stop being pushed aside so easily within Nomadic Bandits. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Nomadic Bandits', 'Wants to keep one decent weapon, one spare repair item, and enough supplies to get through a bad week with Nomadic Bandits. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Nomads', 'Find a decent pair of boots before the current ones fall apart completely. Trade the spare copper ore for something the camp actually needs this time.', ''),
        ('Nomads', 'Keep the goats from wandering too far east where the sand wolves den. Repair the broken strap on the water flask before the next long walk.', ''),
        ('Nomads', 'Memorize the location of that new watering hole the scouts mentioned. Stay on the good side of the elder who allocates the best tent spots.', ''),
        ('Nomads', 'Convince the next traveling merchant to part with salt at a fair price. Check the snares before noon and reset any that are empty or broken.', ''),
        ('Nomads', 'Practice drawing the crossbow faster without snagging the string. Earn enough from escorting caravanners to replace the cracked leather armor.', ''),
        ('Nomads', 'Learn which desert plants can stretch a stew without making everyone sick. Avoid drawing the attention of the surly guard captain who assigns the worst patrols.', ''),
        ('Nomads', 'Sharpen the machete properly tonight instead of putting it off again. Find a shaded route to the southern ruins that avoids Holy Nation patrols.', ''),
        ('Nomads', 'Haggle for better rates when selling the gathered hashish in the border towns. Keep the new recruit from doing something foolish before they learn the desert''s rules.', ''),
        ('Nomads', 'Patch the tent before the wind season tears it to ribbons. Figure out why the pack beast has gone lame and whether it needs rest or a butcher.', ''),
        ('Nomads', 'Save enough cats to buy a second canteen for long hauls. Prove reliable enough to be trusted with the camp''s few firearms.', ''),
        ('Nomads', 'Gather enough wild grain to make bread for the next week. Stay clear of the territorial hunter who claimed the northern ridge as their private grounds.', ''),
        ('Nomads', 'Secure a spot near the campfire when the nights grow cold. Mend the fraying rope on the supply tent before someone trips over it and blames me.', ''),
        ('Nomads', 'Wants to keep a little extra food and clean bandages set aside so life inside Nomads feels less precarious. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Nomads', 'Hopes to hold onto a slightly safer sleeping spot and stop being pushed aside so easily within Nomads. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Nomads', 'Wants to keep one decent weapon, one spare repair item, and enough supplies to get through a bad week with Nomads. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Preacher Cult', 'Wants to keep their moon cleaver sharp enough that no elder can accuse them of neglecting sacred work. Would like to get better at tying prisoners quickly so nobody sees hesitation as weakness. Also hopes to keep one or two dependable cultists close, if only to avoid standing alone when blame starts moving through the village.', ''),
        ('Preacher Cult', 'Hopes to prove they can handle outsider watch without freezing when strangers come too close to the village. Would like to avoid being paired with the most reckless cultists when outsiders are dragged back to the poles. Also hopes to keep one or two dependable cultists close, if only to avoid standing alone when blame starts moving through the village.', ''),
        ('Preacher Cult', 'Wants to notice the first sign of blood rain before someone else claims the omen. Would like to stop minor infections and limping from making them look weak beside healthier cult members. Also hopes to keep one or two dependable cultists close, if only to avoid standing alone when blame starts moving through the village.', ''),
        ('Preacher Cult', 'Hopes to be assigned nearer the village center when the cult gathers to read signs from the Moons. Would like to keep field work, guard work, and ritual duties balanced well enough that the elders stop correcting every small mistake. Also wants enough private food or bandages hidden away that a bad week does not turn into open desperation.', ''),
        ('Preacher Cult', 'Wants to hold onto a slightly drier sleeping corner so old injuries do not stiffen up overnight. Would like to keep their weapon, boots, and work clothes in usable shape without having to beg for replacements. Also wants enough private food or bandages hidden away that a bad week does not turn into open desperation.', ''),
        ('Preacher Cult', 'Hopes to stay useful around the furnace and prisoner grounds without drawing the Preacher''s anger. Would like to remember the Preacher''s sayings well enough to repeat them without being corrected in public. Also wants enough private food or bandages hidden away that a bad week does not turn into open desperation.', ''),
        ('Preacher Cult', 'Wants to avoid being the one blamed if a prisoner slips loose from the metal poles. Would like to earn a little more trust when speaking about omens, harvest signs, and the will of the Moons. Also hopes to avoid punishment long enough to see whether the next strange weather is finally taken as a true sign.', ''),
        ('Preacher Cult', 'Hopes to finish each work stretch with enough strength left to stand through the next rite without collapsing. Would like to learn which chores near the furnace are tolerated and which ones invite punishment if done poorly. Also hopes to avoid punishment long enough to see whether the next strange weather is finally taken as a true sign.', ''),
        ('Preacher Cult', 'Wants to keep their legs working despite old untreated wounds that make field and guard duties harder each week. Would like to carry out ugly routine work without letting fear or disgust show on their face. Also hopes to avoid punishment long enough to see whether the next strange weather is finally taken as a true sign.', ''),
        ('Preacher Cult', 'Hopes to keep enough grain, water, and strength to last through the next failed harvest without losing standing. Would like to avoid being paired with the most reckless cultists when outsiders are dragged back to the poles. Also wants just enough standing to be ordered about less and watched a little less closely.', ''),
        ('Preacher Cult', 'Wants to keep their moon cleaver sharp enough that no elder can accuse them of neglecting sacred work. Would like to stop minor infections and limping from making them look weak beside healthier cult members. Also wants just enough standing to be ordered about less and watched a little less closely.', ''),
        ('Preacher Cult', 'Hopes to prove they can handle outsider watch without freezing when strangers come too close to the village. Would like to get better at tying prisoners quickly so nobody sees hesitation as weakness. Also hopes to stay out of the worst arguments over omens, harvest failures, and who has offended the Moons.', ''),
        ('Preacher Cult', 'Wants to notice the first sign of blood rain before someone else claims the omen. Would like to keep their weapon, boots, and work clothes in usable shape without having to beg for replacements. Also hopes to stay out of the worst arguments over omens, harvest failures, and who has offended the Moons.', ''),
        ('Preacher Cult', 'Hopes to be assigned nearer the village center when the cult gathers to read signs from the Moons. Would like to remember the Preacher''s sayings well enough to repeat them without being corrected in public. Also hopes to stay out of the worst arguments over omens, harvest failures, and who has offended the Moons.', ''),
        ('Preacher Cult', 'Wants to hold onto a slightly drier sleeping corner so old injuries do not stiffen up overnight. Would like to keep field work, guard work, and ritual duties balanced well enough that the elders stop correcting every small mistake. Also wants tomorrow to feel dangerous in the usual way, not like the day their own people decide they are the easiest target.', ''),
        ('Reavers', 'Needs to bring back a captive on the next raid to finally earn a proper cut of the profits. Wants to find a better weapon than this rusted cleaver before the next outing.', ''),
        ('Reavers', 'Hopes to secure a full ration tonight instead of the scraps the newer recruits get. Plans to sleep near the fire pit for once instead of shivering by the shoreline.', ''),
        ('Reavers', 'Must repair the bindings on three slaves before the next trade caravan passes through. Wants to avoid getting assigned to the punishment detail for sloppy work.', ''),
        ('Reavers', 'Needs to memorize another passage of the dark verses before the next gathering. Wants to find a quieter spot in the camp to meditate without the others mocking.', ''),
        ('Reavers', 'Has to patch the leaks in the armor before it falls apart mid-combat. Plans to scavenge a proper weapon strap from the next raided outpost.', ''),
        ('Reavers', 'Needs to trade a captured holy sword for some medkits before the leg wound festers worse. Hopes the captain assigns lighter duties until the injury heals properly.', ''),
        ('Reavers', 'Must inventory the dried fish stores before the storm season hits. Wants to barter for better preserved meat from the southern traders next time they pass.', ''),
        ('Reavers', 'Needs to outperform the rival crew on the next raid to secure better sleeping quarters. Plans to subtly sabotage their boat oars before the competition sets out.', ''),
        ('Reavers', 'Must keep watch on the coastal path for any approaching patrols. Wants to finish the shift early enough to get first pick of the evening meal.', ''),
        ('Reavers', 'Hopes to capture at least two workers from the nearby farmstead before the week ends. Needs to replace the worn net that failed on the last slave run.', ''),
        ('Reavers', 'Wants to stay on the good side of the overseer by reporting any slackers in the crew. Needs to find out who stole the spare boots from the supply tent.', ''),
        ('Reavers', 'Plans to stash a small coin reserve away from the communal pool over the next few raids. Hopes to eventually buy passage on a trading vessel heading somewhere less harsh.', ''),
        ('Reavers', 'Wants to keep a little extra food and clean bandages set aside so life inside Reavers feels less precarious. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Reavers', 'Hopes to hold onto a slightly safer sleeping spot and stop being pushed aside so easily within Reavers. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Reavers', 'Wants to keep one decent weapon, one spare repair item, and enough supplies to get through a bad week with Reavers. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Rebel Farmers', 'Keep the hidden grain stores dry through the rainy season and repair the broken fence before wildlife gets in. A good harvest means the whole camp eats next month.', ''),
        ('Rebel Farmers', 'Sharpen the old machete before the next patrol and check the western trail for fresh tracks. Nobody wants another surprise visit from slavers.', ''),
        ('Rebel Farmers', 'Convince the newcomers that sharing food is how we survive and figure out which of them can actually handle a weapon. Trust takes longer to build than a shelter.', ''),
        ('Rebel Farmers', 'Memorize the safe routes between camps and avoid the main roads near the Holy Nation outposts. Getting caught once means getting caught forever.', ''),
        ('Rebel Farmers', 'Patch the leaky canteen and trade some extra rice for a second shirt before winter. Small comforts matter when you sleep in the dirt.', ''),
        ('Rebel Farmers', 'Learn which wild plants stop bleeding and practice stitching wounds on scrap leather. The camp doctor is getting old and someone has to take over eventually.', ''),
        ('Rebel Farmers', 'Clear the rocks from the new field and get the irrigation ditch finished before the planting moon. Hard soil means hard work but we need every patch growing.', ''),
        ('Rebel Farmers', 'Find out who has been sneaking extra rations and make sure the night watch stays awake until dawn. Discipline keeps a camp alive longer than bravery does.', ''),
        ('Rebel Farmers', 'Scrounge enough copper from the ruins to afford a crossbow and convince the quartermaster to issue me proper bolts. Hunting meat beats eating Gruel every day.', ''),
        ('Rebel Farmers', 'Dig the new latrine farther from the water supply and check the traps along the northern ridge at first light. Clean water and early warnings are the only reasons we are still breathing.', ''),
        ('Rebel Farmers', 'Teach the young ones how to read the weather and make sure the lookouts rotate fairly. Tired sentries make mistakes that kill everyone.', ''),
        ('Rebel Farmers', 'Wants to keep a little extra food and clean bandages set aside so life inside Rebel Farmers feels less precarious. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Rebel Farmers', 'Hopes to hold onto a slightly safer sleeping spot and stop being pushed aside so easily within Rebel Farmers. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Rebel Farmers', 'Wants to keep one decent weapon, one spare repair item, and enough supplies to get through a bad week with Rebel Farmers. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Rebel Farmers', 'Hopes to make themselves useful enough inside Rebel Farmers that people ask for help before they start giving orders. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Red Sabres', 'Needs to replace a chipped katana blade before the next raid, hoping to barter with the quartermaster for a decent one. Also wants to stay on the good side of the crew boss by not complaining about guard shifts.', ''),
        ('Red Sabres', 'Trying to save up enough cats to buy a proper pair of boots, since the current ones are falling apart and causing blisters on long patrols. Keeps meaning to ask the cook for extra rations but hates the hassle of owing favors.', ''),
        ('Red Sabres', 'Wants to find a better route through the canyons that avoids the skin spider nests, since losing another member to wildlife is bad for morale. Also working on lockpicking skills during downtime to be more useful on caravan jobs.', ''),
        ('Red Sabres', 'Worried about a persistent cough that won''t go away, hoping to trade some stolen medicine from the last haul without drawing attention. Needs to prove the injury won''t slow things down before the boss reassigns the easy work.', ''),
        ('Red Sabres', 'Hoping to get assigned to the southern watchtower where there''s more shade and less foot traffic. Has been angling for a spot on the next slave run to boost personal cut, but doesn''t want to seem too eager in front of the veterans.', ''),
        ('Red Sabres', 'Trying to teach the new recruits basic sword drills without losing patience, since the boss asked and refusing isn''t an option. Also wants to mend a gap in the perimeter fence before something wanders in at night.', ''),
        ('Red Sabres', 'Looking for a reliable source of clean water that doesn''t require a half-day hike, since the local spring has been running muddy. Wants to finish reinforcing the shack''s door frame after the last windstorm nearly tore it off.', ''),
        ('Red Sabres', 'Saving up for a decent quality grappling hook to replace the makeshift rope ladder currently in use, since the old one nearly gave out last climb. Trying to stay off the boss''s radar after a sloppy job last week.', ''),
        ('Red Sabres', 'Hoping to trade some dried meat for a second canteen, since one isn''t enough for extended scouting runs. Needs to find a better hiding spot for personal stash before someone else snoops around the bunk area.', ''),
        ('Red Sabres', 'Wants to get the crossbow string replaced before it snaps at the worst possible moment, and the quartermaster has been stingy with supplies lately. Also trying to work out a rotation with the night watch so sleep isn''t so broken up.', ''),
        ('Red Sabres', 'Looking to pick up some basic first aid skills from whoever knows more than bandaging, since the nearest proper medic is days away. Has been volunteering for supply runs to get out of camp and avoid a growing tension with another member.', ''),
        ('Red Sabres', 'Trying to earn enough trust to be included on the higher-paying caravan ambushes instead of stuck on garrison duty. Also keeping an ear out for any word on bounties in the area, since that kind of information is worth good favor.', ''),
        ('Red Sabres', 'Wants to keep a little extra food and clean bandages set aside so life inside Red Sabres feels less precarious. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Red Sabres', 'Hopes to hold onto a slightly safer sleeping spot and stop being pushed aside so easily within Red Sabres. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
