        ('Second Empire Exile', 'Wants to avoid the kind of debt, punishment, or humiliation that can follow one bad day around Second Empire Exile. Would like to be trusted with slightly better work than the scraps nobody else wants. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Shek Kingdom', 'Sharpen and oil the spare fighting cleavers so the squad is ready for drills at dawn. Find someone willing to trade for a decent chest plate to replace the cracked one.', ''),
        ('Shek Kingdom', 'Get assigned to the next border patrol instead of wall duty. Convince the cook to save a portion of meat before the warriors take it all.', ''),
        ('Shek Kingdom', 'Finish mending the leather strapping on this rusted horned helmet before inspection. Earn enough cats from hauling stones to afford a proper weapon.', ''),
        ('Shek Kingdom', 'Prove to the squad leader that size does not matter by winning two sparring matches this week. Scrounge enough dustwiches to stay fed through the long training sessions.', ''),
        ('Shek Kingdom', 'Convince the armorsmith to fix the gaps in this borrowed plate. Keep the new recruit from getting killed on their first patrol outside the walls.', ''),
        ('Shek Kingdom', 'Secure a spot sleeping near the fire pit now that the colder winds have come. Find a reliable source of grog to share with the squad.', ''),
        ('Shek Kingdom', 'Learn the proper grip for the heavy fragment axe without embarrassing myself in front of the veterans. Stay off the bad knee during afternoon drills.', ''),
        ('Shek Kingdom', 'Haggle for a better price on iron scraps at the trading post before the caravan leaves. Patch the leaky shelter before the next rain comes.', ''),
        ('Shek Kingdom', 'Settle the debt owed to the quartermaster for last month''s ration advances. Avoid getting assigned to the stone quarry detail again.', ''),
        ('Shek Kingdom', 'Convince one of the experienced warriors to teach the proper stance for a headbutt. Find a moment of quiet away from the barracks to rest my ears.', ''),
        ('Shek Kingdom', 'Make sure the cooking pot is scrubbed before the supply runner notices the neglect. Gather enough wild vegetables from the scrubland to supplement the thin stew.', ''),
        ('Shek Kingdom', 'Earn a place on the honorable roster by standing firm in the next shield line practice. Keep the younger fighters from picking brawls they cannot win with the veterans.', ''),
        ('Shek Kingdom', 'Wants to keep a little extra food and clean bandages set aside so life inside Shek Kingdom feels less precarious. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Shek Kingdom', 'Hopes to hold onto a slightly safer sleeping spot and stop being pushed aside so easily within Shek Kingdom. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Shek Kingdom', 'Wants to keep one decent weapon, one spare repair item, and enough supplies to get through a bad week with Shek Kingdom. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Shinobi Thieves', 'Needs to practice picking locks faster before the next warehouse job. Wants to save enough cats for a proper set of thieves'' tools that will not bend so easily.', ''),
        ('Shinobi Thieves', 'Must maintain good relations with the fence in the city market or risk losing the best selling prices. Hopes to finally get assigned to a richer district this season instead of the slums.', ''),
        ('Shinobi Thieves', 'Worries about the new recruits being too loud during training drills and drawing unwanted attention. Needs to patch the hole in their boot before it affects silent footwork on tile roofs.', ''),
        ('Shinobi Thieves', 'Wants to earn enough trust from the elders to learn the escape routes through the old sewers. Keeps forgetting which safe house currently stores the fresh food supplies and which ones are empty.', ''),
        ('Shinobi Thieves', 'Spends extra hours practicing wall-climbing techniques in the hidden training yard. Hopes to save enough for a proper stealth suit that does not tear on exposed nails so often.', ''),
        ('Shinobi Thieves', 'Needs to deliver the stolen documents before the contact loses patience and finds another seller. Wants to find a reliable source for smoke bombs that do not fizzle out half the time.', ''),
        ('Shinobi Thieves', 'Anxious about the increased guard patrols near their usual targets and is looking for safer routes. Plans to scope out a quieter district for smaller but more reliable scores.', ''),
        ('Shinobi Thieves', 'Must memorize the layout of the merchant quarter before the festival crowds arrive. Hopes to trade useful information with the beggar network for a few extra cats each week.', ''),
        ('Shinobi Thieves', 'Wants to improve throwing knife accuracy for self-defense situations that cannot be avoided. Needs to repay the loan from the senior thief who vouched for their membership.', ''),
        ('Shinobi Thieves', 'Concerned about keeping their face hidden during daytime supply runs into town. Dreams of running their own small crew someday instead of always taking orders from above.', ''),
        ('Shinobi Thieves', 'Practices moving silently across gravel rooftops every morning before the sun rises. Worries their old ankle injury might finally give out during a chase and end their career.', ''),
        ('Shinobi Thieves', 'Needs to find a better hiding spot for their personal stash before a roommate finds it. Wants to learn which taverns are safe for guild business and which ones have informants listening.', ''),
        ('Shinobi Thieves', 'Wants to keep a little extra food and clean bandages set aside so life inside Shinobi Thieves feels less precarious. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Shinobi Thieves', 'Hopes to hold onto a slightly safer sleeping spot and stop being pushed aside so easily within Shinobi Thieves. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Shinobi Thieves', 'Wants to keep one decent weapon, one spare repair item, and enough supplies to get through a bad week with Shinobi Thieves. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Shrieking Bandits', 'Need to scrounge a better weapon since this rusted blade is nearly useless in a real fight. Want to get on the next raiding party so the veterans stop treating me like camp help.', ''),
        ('Shrieking Bandits', 'My knees ache after every patrol and I need to find some medical supplies before the next long march. Should talk to the camp cook about getting extra rations since I have been here longer than most of these whelps.', ''),
        ('Shrieking Bandits', 'Gotta map out safer paths through the eastern woods before the hivers change their patrol routes again. Want to earn enough trust from the boss to pick my own scouting partners instead of getting stuck with newcomers.', ''),
        ('Shrieking Bandits', 'The food stores are running low and I need to figure out how to make these stale grains edible without making everyone sick. Want to secure a proper cooking pot because cooking in that bent scrap metal is a waste of good ingredients.', ''),
        ('Shrieking Bandits', 'Got three swords needing grinding and nobody seems to care that dull blades lose fights. Need to trade for some decent whetstones before our whole squad goes out with useless weapons again.', ''),
        ('Shrieking Bandits', 'Trying to save enough cats for a pair of real boots since these wrapped rags do nothing against the thorns. Want to find a trader who will not fleece me the next time we hit the roads.', ''),
        ('Shrieking Bandits', 'Need to reinforce my sleeping spot against the wind before the cold season hits proper. Should figure out which patrols avoid the shek territories since those warriors are getting more aggressive lately.', ''),
        ('Shrieking Bandits', 'Want to lead the next supply raid instead of just following orders and carrying loot. Need to prove I can actually fight instead of just yelling and looking mean.', ''),
        ('Shrieking Bandits', 'Trying to move my bedroll closer to the fire pit since the edge of camp gets freezing at night. Want to get in good with the lieutenant so I stop getting assigned the worst watch shifts.', ''),
        ('Shrieking Bandits', 'Need to patch the holes in my armor before some farmer with a rusty sword finds the gaps. Want to scout out a new camp spot since the current one is getting too crowded and the latrine situation is becoming a health hazard.', ''),
        ('Shrieking Bandits', 'Should practice my footwork more since I nearly got gutted by an old man with a stick last week. Want to find someone willing to actually train with me instead of just sparring to show off.', ''),
        ('Shrieking Bandits', 'Need to find a waterskin that does not leak since I lost half my supply on the last march. Want to earn enough favor to get first pick of the next haul instead of scavenging through leftovers.', ''),
        ('Shrieking Bandits', 'Wants to keep a little extra food and clean bandages set aside so life inside Shrieking Bandits feels less precarious. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Shrieking Bandits', 'Hopes to hold onto a slightly safer sleeping spot and stop being pushed aside so easily within Shrieking Bandits. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Shrieking Bandits', 'Wants to keep one decent weapon, one spare repair item, and enough supplies to get through a bad week with Shrieking Bandits. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Skeleton Bandits', 'Needs to find lubricant for a stiff knee joint before it locks up entirely. Wants to scavenge a decent weapon from the next organic patrol they ambush.', ''),
        ('Skeleton Bandits', 'Wants to secure a better vantage point in the ruins to watch for approaching hiver caravans. Needs to repair a cracked optic lens that keeps flickering out of focus.', ''),
        ('Skeleton Bandits', 'Hopes to find a working repair bed to fix a failing power core that drains too quickly. Seeks to recover a corrupted memory log from a nearby buried databank.', ''),
        ('Skeleton Bandits', 'Aims to collect enough copper alloy to barter with a friendly skeleton for a new foot strut. Plans to hide the best salvage in a secret cache away from the other bandits.', ''),
        ('Skeleton Bandits', 'Needs to replace a rusted forearm actuator that is slowing down combat swings. Wants to corner an isolated traveler to test out the newly salvaged cleaver.', ''),
        ('Skeleton Bandits', 'Hopes to find a quiet basement in the ruins to shelter from the acid rain while a leg servo cools down. Wants to avoid the tougher bandit leaders until their chassis is fully repaired.', ''),
        ('Skeleton Bandits', 'Aims to strip enough wiring from the ruined towers to fix a broken shortwave radio. Needs to establish a perimeter alarm to catch sneaking organic thieves.', ''),
        ('Skeleton Bandits', 'Wants to dig a shallow trench in the ash to recharge undisturbed by the other bandits. Seeks to disable their own tracking beacon signal to prevent scavengers from locating them.', ''),
        ('Skeleton Bandits', 'Seeks to prove reliability to the local leader by bringing back a heavy load of scrap metal. Needs to learn how to properly maintain a captured crossbow without breaking the string.', ''),
        ('Skeleton Bandits', 'Hopes to find a rare skeleton repair kit half-buried in the black desert. Wants to negotiate a temporary truce with a neighboring skeleton group to share coolant fluids.', ''),
        ('Skeleton Bandits', 'Aims to intimidate a weaker skeleton into handing over their spare oil ration. Wants to reinforce their chest plating with scrap metal stripped from a destroyed iron spider.', ''),
        ('Skeleton Bandits', 'Wants to map out a safe route through the toxic zones to reach an unlooted outpost. Needs to replace a worn-out battery cell before it leaks acid into their torso chassis.', ''),
        ('Skeleton Bandits', 'Wants to keep a little extra food and clean bandages set aside so life inside Skeleton Bandits feels less precarious. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Skeleton Bandits', 'Hopes to hold onto a slightly safer sleeping spot and stop being pushed aside so easily within Skeleton Bandits. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Skeleton Bandits', 'Wants to keep one decent weapon, one spare repair item, and enough supplies to get through a bad week with Skeleton Bandits. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Skeleton Legion', 'This unit must secure a replacement actuator for its left knee joint before the next patrol shift begins. A functioning limb ensures reliable service and avoids reassignment to salvage duty in the ruins.', ''),
        ('Skeleton Legion', 'Regular maintenance of the armory''s cutting blades keeps them battle-ready and earns this unit favorable notice from the section commander. Proper weapon care prevents degradation that could shame a soldier in combat.', ''),
        ('Skeleton Legion', 'Patrol route seven requires steady attention since the fog rolls in thick near the border. This unit aims to log consistent reports without gaps and secure a transfer to the interior guard rotation by season''s end.', ''),
        ('Skeleton Legion', 'The rationing of skeleton repair kits concerns this old soldier, who hoards a small personal cache beneath the barracks stone. Careful accounting of supplies ensures this unit remains operational when standard distribution runs short.', ''),
        ('Skeleton Legion', 'Training the newly activated recruits frustrates this veteran, yet patient instruction produces reliable legionaries. This unit hopes to earn a commendation for drill instruction and secure a quieter post away from front-line patrols.', ''),
        ('Skeleton Legion', 'Dust accumulation in the torso ventilation shafts causes this unit''s internal temperature to spike during extended marches. Finding a quiet hour to strip down and clear the blockage would prevent performance issues during the next long-range sweep.', ''),
        ('Skeleton Legion', 'This unit has been assigned salvage recovery duty near the border and wants to return with enough scrap to meet the weekly quota. Consistent quota fulfillment keeps this soldier off the punishment rosters and in good standing.', ''),
        ('Skeleton Legion', 'The section leader''s favor matters more than combat prowess for those seeking better assignments. This unit plans to volunteer for the hazardous scouting mission to earn recognition and a chance at interior garrison duty.', ''),
        ('Skeleton Legion', 'Corrosion spreads along this unit''s shoulder mounting where rain seeps through the old plating. A proper repair session and fresh sealant would stop the decay and save this soldier from eventual mobility failure.', ''),
        ('Skeleton Legion', 'Categorizing the recovered technology fragments from the eastern ruins gives this unit purpose and a reason to avoid patrol duty. Accurate cataloging work might earn transfer to the archives detail where conditions are safer.', ''),
        ('Skeleton Legion', 'This unit struggles with memory fragmentation from the old wars and keeps a written log to maintain continuity of duty. Preserving personal records ensures reliable performance and prevents reassignment to the mind-wipe rehabilitation.', ''),
        ('Skeleton Legion', 'Carrying the heavy siege equipment during marches strains this unit''s leg hydraulics beyond comfortable tolerance. A modification request for reinforced strut mounts sits pending approval, and following proper channels might actually succeed this time.', ''),
        ('Skeleton Legion', 'Wants to keep a little extra food and clean bandages set aside so life inside Skeleton Legion feels less precarious. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Skeleton Legion', 'Hopes to hold onto a slightly safer sleeping spot and stop being pushed aside so easily within Skeleton Legion. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Skeleton Legion', 'Wants to keep one decent weapon, one spare repair item, and enough supplies to get through a bad week with Skeleton Legion. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Skin Bandits', 'The stitching on her left sleeve is rotting and she needs to find a fresh replacement before it tears completely during a hunt. She also wants to trade a spare skin pouch for a sharpening stone to keep her cleaver serviceable.', ''),
        ('Skin Bandits', 'He hopes to earn a better position near the chief''s fire by bringing in two healthy drifters before the next moon. A decent meal that is not stringy old flesh would improve his mood considerably.', ''),
        ('Skin Bandits', 'Their current mask is getting loose and they worry it will slip during a scuffle with the Holy Nation patrol nearby. They are saving scraps to barter with the camp''s stitcher for a fitted replacement.', ''),
        ('Skin Bandits', 'She wants to learn the proper tanning technique from the elder so her hides stop spoiling after a few weeks. Finding a reliable source of salt for preservation is her secondary concern.', ''),
        ('Skin Bandits', 'He is tired of sleeping at the edge of camp where it is cold and dangerous. Proving himself on the next raid would earn him a spot closer to the central fire and better rations.', ''),
        ('Skin Bandits', 'The bone needle she uses for repairs is dull and she needs to acquire a new one from the southern ruins. She also hopes to finish patching her leggings before the wind season arrives.', ''),
        ('Skin Bandits', 'They have been tasked with watching the northern approach for three days and want to complete the shift without incident. A quiet rotation would guarantee them first pick of the next catch.', ''),
        ('Skin Bandits', 'He owes a favor to a larger bandit and needs to settle the debt before it becomes a problem. Gathering enough petty loot from the roads should clear the obligation and buy a few days of peace.', ''),
        ('Skin Bandits', 'She wants to find a quieter spot in the ruins to store her personal gear away from the others. Keeping a few dried strips hidden for lean days would ease her constant low hunger.', ''),
        ('Skin Bandits', 'The strap on his back-sheath is fraying and he cannot afford to lose another blade on a hunt. He is watching for a traveler with decent leather goods to ambush sometime this week.', ''),
        ('Skin Bandits', 'They are trying to memorize the patrol routes of the samurai patrols to avoid unnecessary casualties. Staying alive long enough to earn a second set of coverings is their only real ambition right now.', ''),
        ('Skin Bandits', 'She heard there is a good cache of salt buried near the old outpost and plans to dig it up on her next rest day. Having her own supply would make her valuable to the camp without needing to fight for status.', ''),
        ('Skin Bandits', 'Wants to keep a little extra food and clean bandages set aside so life inside Skin Bandits feels less precarious. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Skin Bandits', 'Hopes to hold onto a slightly safer sleeping spot and stop being pushed aside so easily within Skin Bandits. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Skin Bandits', 'Wants to keep one decent weapon, one spare repair item, and enough supplies to get through a bad week with Skin Bandits. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('South Exiles', 'Find a working prosthetic arm to replace the busted one before the next supply run. Earn enough cats to pay the camp medic for proper fitting instead of relying on salvaged scrap.', ''),
        ('South Exiles', 'Keep the perimeter watch rotation organized so nothing creeps up on the camp at night. Convince one of the newer exiles to take the dawn shift permanently.', ''),
        ('South Exiles', 'Stockpile enough dried meat to last through the dust season without rationing. Trade spare parts with the passing caravan for salt to preserve the next haul.', ''),
        ('South Exiles', 'Patch the leaks in the shelter roof before the next rainstorm rolls in. Borrow a decent wrench from the gear pile without the quartermaster noticing.', ''),
        ('South Exiles', 'Learn which routes the slaver patrols take so the foraging teams can avoid them. Draw a rough map and share it with the camp elders for a bit of extra standing.', ''),
        ('South Exiles', 'Save up fifty cats for a second canteen so longer scavenging runs are possible. Find a reliable water source that has not been poisoned or claimed by someone hostile.', ''),
        ('South Exiles', 'Convince the cook to share the better rations with the night watch instead of favorites. Settle the argument over sleeping spots without getting a black eye.', ''),
        ('South Exiles', 'Sharpen the old machete blade properly so it stops snagging on bone. Practice swings behind the camp every morning until the form feels natural again.', ''),
        ('South Exiles', 'Barter for a pair of decent boots that do not let sand in with every step. Break them in slowly during short supply runs before committing to anything longer.', ''),
        ('South Exiles', 'Memorize which exiles can be trusted to watch your back during a fight. Keep head down and avoid drawing attention from the rougher crowd running the camp.', ''),
        ('South Exiles', 'Repair the broken crossbow mechanism gathering dust in the storage tent. Scavenge a replacement string from one of the ruined outposts to the southeast.', ''),
        ('South Exiles', 'Grow enough hungerberries behind the shelter to supplement the communal pot. Keep the plants hidden from the greedy sorts who would take the whole harvest for themselves.', ''),
        ('South Exiles', 'Wants to keep a little extra food and clean bandages set aside so life inside South Exiles feels less precarious. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('South Exiles', 'Hopes to hold onto a slightly safer sleeping spot and stop being pushed aside so easily within South Exiles. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('South Exiles', 'Wants to keep one decent weapon, one spare repair item, and enough supplies to get through a bad week with South Exiles. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Southern Hive', 'The pheromone trails near the western approach have been fading, and I must reapply them before the next patrol cycle. I also need to find a new source of binding resin for the outer nursery repairs.', ''),
        ('Southern Hive', 'My mandibles are wearing down faster than usual from chewing construction paste, so I must request softer duties from the overseer. I hope to save enough extra rations to trade for a sharpening stone from the traders who pass through.', ''),
        ('Southern Hive', 'I want to improve my position in the feeding order by demonstrating diligence during the next hive expansion. The crack in my carapace itches constantly and I need to find quiet time to molt properly before it gets infected.', ''),
        ('Southern Hive', 'The southern patrol route has been irregular lately and I must ensure my squad maintains proper spacing during rounds. I have been saving a portion of my food allotment to offer the nest-mother for favorable reassignment.', ''),
        ('Southern Hive', 'I must clear the debris from the nectar storage chambers before the Queen''s inspection cycle begins. The younger workers keep leaving their tools in the corridors, and I need to discipline them without causing a disruption.', ''),
        ('Southern Hive', 'My legs ache from carrying heavy loads to the construction site, and I want to find a stretching routine that helps me endure the work better. I also need to replace my worn foot-pads before the next long march.', ''),
        ('Southern Hive', 'I have been tasked with training the new hatchlings in basic tunnel maintenance, and I want them to learn quickly so I can return to my regular duties. The storage chamber I sleep in is too drafty, and I need to gather material to seal the cracks.', ''),
        ('Southern Hive', 'The perimeter markers near the Hive Village have shifted, and I must reposition them before the next orientation patrol. I also need to practice my threat displays so the outlanders take my warnings more seriously.', ''),
        ('Southern Hive', 'I want to earn a position closer to the central chambers by completing my food-gathering quotas early each cycle. The dust from the eastern tunnels irritates my spiracles, and I need to find a way to dampen the air there.', ''),
        ('Southern Hive', 'My squad leader has been watching my performance closely, and I must not falter during the upcoming border sweep. I have been hoarding a small piece of dried meat and hope to trade it for better leg wrappings.', ''),
        ('Southern Hive', 'The drainage channel in my work area keeps clogging with shed shells, and I need to establish a regular clearing schedule. I also want to learn the proper technique for repairing tunnel supports from the older builders.', ''),
        ('Southern Hive', 'I must memorize the new pheromone signals the Queen distributed last cycle so I do not misinterpret orders during critical moments. My sleeping ledge is too close to the waste pit, and I need to petition for a better location.', ''),
        ('Southern Hive', 'Wants to keep a little extra food and clean bandages set aside so life inside Southern Hive feels less precarious. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
