        ('Starving Bandits', 'Wants to avoid the kind of debt, punishment, or humiliation that can follow one bad day around Starving Bandits. Would like to be trusted with slightly better work than the scraps nobody else wants. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Stone Rats', 'Needs to scrounge enough copper to pay this week''s tribute to the camp boss. Hopes to earn a spot closer to the fire instead of sleeping near the entrance where the wind cuts through.', ''),
        ('Stone Rats', 'Worries about the rust eating through the plating on her favorite blade. Wants to secure a replacement by trading salvage from the next raid before the edge gives out entirely.', ''),
        ('Stone Rats', 'Plans to scout the abandoned mine shafts for leftover tools and copper ore. Dreams of saving enough cats to afford a proper pair of boots before the next season changes.', ''),
        ('Stone Rats', 'Keeps track of the camp''s food stores and knows they''re running low. Intends to organize a hunting party before the others notice the shortage and start getting ideas.', ''),
        ('Stone Rats', 'Spends each evening patching the leather straps on his armor with whatever scrap he can find. Aims to convince the quartermaster to issue him a steel blade instead of this rusted machete.', ''),
        ('Stone Rats', 'Doesn''t trust the new recruits who joined last moon and watches them closely. Plans to test their loyalty by seeing how they divide the next haul when nobody''s looking.', ''),
        ('Stone Rats', 'His knees ache from years of running and fighting, and he wants a spot on a softer bedroll. Hopes to trade his shift guarding the perimeter for lighter cooking duties before winter sets in.', ''),
        ('Stone Rats', 'Keeps watch from the high rocks every day, scanning the flats for Skinners and slavers. Needs to find a working pair of binoculars to replace the cracked one she''s been squinting through.', ''),
        ('Stone Rats', 'Lost two fingers to a trap last year and still hasn''t adjusted to the grip. Saving up for a cheap prosthetic that will let her hold a sword properly again.', ''),
        ('Stone Rats', 'Recovering from a gut wound and worried it might fester in this filth. Wants to trade a stolen knife for some proper medical supplies before the infection gets worse.', ''),
        ('Stone Rats', 'Trying to stay on the good side of both the camp boss and his rival without picking a side. Figures that being useful to both is the safest way to avoid getting caught in their feud.', ''),
        ('Stone Rats', 'Responsible for showing the fresh meat how to hold a blade without cutting themselves. Wishes he had a proper training dummy instead of making do with rotten fence posts.', ''),
        ('Stone Rats', 'Wants to keep a little extra food and clean bandages set aside so life inside Stone Rats feels less precarious. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
