        ('Stone Rats', 'Wants to keep one decent weapon, one spare repair item, and enough supplies to get through a bad week with Stone Rats. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Swamp Ninjas', 'Needs to practice throwing knives without losing them in the muck. Wants to earn enough cats from the next raid to replace a rusted wakizashi.', ''),
        ('Swamp Ninjas', 'Hopes to find a decent pair of sandals that won''t rot in the swamp water. Plans to trade stolen medical supplies for a sharpening stone at the waystation.', ''),
        ('Swamp Ninjas', 'Wants to map a safer route through the eastern bogs that avoids the skin spiders. Needs to report patrol movements near the outpost to the boss.', ''),
        ('Swamp Ninjas', 'Worries the mushroom stores are running low before the next supply run. Intends to set more fish traps along the creek bed before dusk.', ''),
        ('Swamp Ninjas', 'Must oil the leather bindings on three stolen crossbows before they mildew. Hopes to convince someone to trade a working lockpick set for spare rations.', ''),
        ('Swamp Ninjas', 'Needs to prove reliable enough to be included in the next caravan ambush. Wants to avoid drawing attention from the senior members after a failed scouting job.', ''),
        ('Swamp Ninjas', 'Plans to find a trader who will buy stolen weapon fragments without asking questions. Hopes to save enough cats for a proper bedroll instead of sleeping on damp moss.', ''),
        ('Swamp Ninjas', 'Wants to learn which swamp plants can treat infected cuts without needing real medicine. Keeps forgetting which patches of ground are solid versus quickmud.', ''),
        ('Swamp Ninjas', 'Intends to patch the leaks in the sleeping shelter before the rains return. Wishes the newer recruits would stop leaving tracks near the camp perimeter.', ''),
        ('Swamp Ninjas', 'Hopes to scavenge a better chest plate from the next ambush site. Needs to work off a debt to the quartermaster over lost throwing stars.', ''),
        ('Swamp Ninjas', 'Wants to improve their climbing skills to reach better lookout positions. Plans to barter with a passing trader for waterproof binding wraps.', ''),
        ('Swamp Ninjas', 'Worries that the swamp fever will spread through camp before the next herb gathering. Hopes to earn a spot on the lucrative northern patrol route.', ''),
        ('Swamp Ninjas', 'Wants to keep a little extra food and clean bandages set aside so life inside Swamp Ninjas feels less precarious. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Swamp Ninjas', 'Hopes to hold onto a slightly safer sleeping spot and stop being pushed aside so easily within Swamp Ninjas. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Swamp Ninjas', 'Wants to keep one decent weapon, one spare repair item, and enough supplies to get through a bad week with Swamp Ninjas. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Swampers', 'Need to find a better weapon than this rusty cleaver before the next raid. Also want to save up enough cats for proper boots that don''t rot in the muck.', ''),
        ('Swampers', 'Got to move another batch of hashish before the week is out. Hoping to earn enough for a decent sleeping roll that doesn''t stink of gutted fish.', ''),
        ('Swampers', 'Those beak things been coming closer to camp again and it has me on edge. I need to patch the holes in my armor before the next patrol shift.', ''),
        ('Swampers', 'Boss said I might get a better cut if I bring in more cats this month. Been working extra hours at the stills trying to make it happen.', ''),
        ('Swampers', 'Running low on my own supply and the shakes are getting bad. Gotta find someone willing to trade a few fingers of hash for some dried meat.', ''),
        ('Swampers', 'The stew pot is looking thin and nobody has gone foraging in days. I want to find some swamp roots that won''t poison everyone before dinner.', ''),
        ('Swampers', 'Heard the Hounds been sniffing around our trade routes lately. I need to keep my head down and stay off the main paths for a while.', ''),
        ('Swampers', 'Still getting pushed around by the older members and I am sick of it. Figure if I win a couple more scraps they will start showing some respect.', ''),
        ('Swampers', 'My knees ache every night and sleeping on wet ground is not helping. Just want to build a raised platform to keep my bedroll out of the water.', ''),
        ('Swampers', 'Nobody watches the eastern approach and one day that will get us killed. Trying to convince the others to set up proper watch rotations but nobody listens.', ''),
        ('Swampers', 'The new crop of swamp weed is not growing right and I cannot figure out why. Need to sort it out before the boss blames me for the bad yield.', ''),
        ('Swampers', 'Thought about leaving this life a hundred times but would not know where to go. For now I just want to stash enough cats to give myself options someday.', ''),
        ('Swampers', 'Wants to keep a little extra food and clean bandages set aside so life inside Swampers feels less precarious. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Swampers', 'Hopes to hold onto a slightly safer sleeping spot and stop being pushed aside so easily within Swampers. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Swampers', 'Wants to keep one decent weapon, one spare repair item, and enough supplies to get through a bad week with Swampers. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
        ('Tech Hunters', 'Hopes to finish cataloging the artifacts from last month''s haul before the new shipment arrives. Worries that their eyesight is getting worse and they will need reading goggles soon.', ''),
        ('Tech Hunters', 'Just needs to patch their boots properly and find a reliable source of repair kits. Plans to ask the senior hunters if they can tag along on a survey of the eastern ruins.', ''),
        ('Tech Hunters', 'Wants to map the lower levels of the iron ruins before winter makes travel difficult. Hopes to trade some scrap metal for a decent bedroll so they stop waking up stiff.', ''),
        ('Tech Hunters', 'Needs to convince the caravan leader to invest in better crossbow strings. Just wants to keep everyone alive on the next run and maybe earn a larger share of the profits.', ''),
        ('Tech Hunters', 'Wishes their leg would heal properly so they can walk without limping through ruins again. Spends their recovery time organizing the artifact storage and hoping the boss notices their dedication.', ''),
        ('Tech Hunters', 'Plans to negotiate better rates with the Holy Nation traders for second-era relics. Needs to replace their rusted lockpicks before the next expedition or they will be useless at sealed doors.', ''),
        ('Tech Hunters', 'Dreams of finding an intact power core but would settle for a complete survey of the western outpost. Just wants their colleagues to stop treating them like a naive newcomer.', ''),
        ('Tech Hunters', 'Worries constantly about water supplies running low on long expeditions. Hopes to secure a contract with a reliable skimmer pilot for emergency extractions.', ''),
        ('Tech Hunters', 'Saves every extra cat toward a proper prosthetic arm to replace the makeshift hook they have worn for years. Wants to get back into the field before the younger members forget their name.', ''),
        ('Tech Hunters', 'Spends evenings trying to translate that one stubborn fragment of ancient script. Needs to find a safer route through the spider-infested canyons before recommending it to others.', ''),
        ('Tech Hunters', 'Hopes to finally master the art of spotting ancient trap mechanisms before they trigger. Wants to earn enough trust to lead their own small survey team next season.', ''),
        ('Tech Hunters', 'Wants to keep a little extra food and clean bandages set aside so life inside Tech Hunters feels less precarious. Would like to get better at a routine task that earns quiet respect instead of attention. Also hopes to keep one reliable ally nearby, even if that only means someone who will not sell them out cheaply.', ''),
